<h2>8. API Design (key endpoints)</h2>

<h3>8.1 Phase 1</h3>
<pre><code>AUTH   POST /auth/register /auth/login /auth/refresh /auth/logout
       POST /auth/forgot-password /auth/reset-password
       GET  /auth/oauth/:provider /auth/oauth/:provider/callback
       POST /auth/oauth/:provider/link /auth/oauth/accounts
       DELETE /auth/oauth/:provider

USERS  GET /users/me  PATCH /users/me

JOBS   GET /jobs (search + filter)  GET /jobs/:id
       POST /jobs  PATCH /jobs/:id  DELETE /jobs/:id
       POST /jobs/:id/apply

CVs    GET /cvs  POST /cvs/upload  GET /cvs/:id

APPS   GET /applications/me  GET /applications/:id  PATCH /applications/:id/status

SEARCH GET /search  GET /search/insight

CHAT   GET /conversations  GET /conversations/:id/messages  POST /conversations/:id/messages

NOTIF  GET /notifications  PATCH /notifications/:id/read

ADMIN  GET /admin/stats /admin/users /admin/jobs/pending
       PATCH /admin/users/:id/ban /admin/jobs/:id/approve</code></pre>

<h3>8.2 Phase 2 (Auto-screening)</h3>
<pre><code>SCAN   POST /scan/run/:applicationId   (chạy scan ngay hoặc queue)
       GET  /scan/result/:applicationId
       POST /scan/bulk

GITHUB GET  /github/lookup/:username
       GET  /github/lookup/cv/:cvId
       POST /github/refresh/:cvId

REF    GET  /references/application/:id
       POST /references/:id/send
       GET  /references/verify?token=
       POST /references/:id/respond</code></pre>

<h3>8.3 Phase 3 (AI Test + Schedule)</h3>
<pre><code>TEST   POST /tests/generate  GET /tests/:id
       POST /tests/assign
       GET  /tests/take/:token
       POST /tests/submit/:token
       GET  /tests/result/:assignmentId

SCHED  GET  /schedule/availability/:interviewerId
       POST /schedule/interview
       GET  /schedule/interview/confirm?token=
       POST /schedule/interview/:id/cancel
       POST /schedule/interview/:id/feedback

DFLOW  POST /dialogflow/webhook</code></pre>

<hr>

<h2>9. Tích hợp n8n — Workflows chi tiết</h2>

<h3>9.1 Kiến trúc</h3>
<p>n8n chạy riêng như 1 Docker container. Backend giao tiếp qua webhook:</p>
<pre>
Backend --(POST webhook)--> n8n workflow --> gọi action --> (callback) Backend
</pre>

<h3>9.2 Workflows</h3>

<h4>WF1: CV Scan Trigger</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Webhook nhận <code>{applicationId, jobId, cvId}</code>.</li>
  <li>Gọi backend API để lấy CV parsed + JD requirements.</li>
  <li>Gọi OpenAI API để chấm điểm.</li>
  <li>Tính GitHub lookup.</li>
  <li>Gọi OpenAI để verify references có email.</li>
  <li>Tổng hợp <code>ai_match_reasoning</code> + <code>ai_match_score</code>.</li>
  <li>Callback backend <code>PATCH /applications/:id</code> với kết quả.</li>
  <li>Nếu <code>score &lt; 50</code> → trigger WF4 (auto-reject).</li>
</ul>

<h4>WF2: Reference Verification</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Webhook nhận <code>{referenceId, refereeEmail}</code>.</li>
  <li>Sinh token xác minh 32 char.</li>
  <li>Gửi email qua SMTP với link <code>/references/verify?token=...</code>.</li>
  <li>Lưu log vào <code>n8n_workflow_logs</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h4>WF3: Interview Reminder (Cron)</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Cron mỗi 15 phút.</li>
  <li>Query <code>interviews</code> có <code>scheduled_at</code> trong 24h/2h/15m tới và chưa gửi reminder.</li>
  <li>Gửi email + push notification qua backend webhook.</li>
  <li>Update <code>reminder_*_sent = true</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h4>WF4: Auto-Reject</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Webhook nhận <code>{applicationId, reason}</code>.</li>
  <li>Render email template (tiếng Việt + Anh).</li>
  <li>Gửi qua SMTP.</li>
  <li>Lưu <code>email_logs</code>.</li>
  <li>Update application status = <code>rejected</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h4>WF5: AI Test</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Webhook nhận <code>{testId, applicationId}</code>.</li>
  <li>LLM sinh câu hỏi (IQ hoặc English theo level).</li>
  <li>Sinh access token, link <code>/tests/take/{token}</code>.</li>
  <li>Gửi email cho ứng viên.</li>
  <li>Lưu <code>test_assignments</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h4>WF6: Interview Confirmation</h4>
<ul>
  <li>Webhook nhận <code>{interviewId, action: 'confirm' | 'reschedule' | 'cancel'}</code>.</li>
  <li>Cập nhật status.</li>
  <li>Gửi email xác nhận cho HR.</li>
  <li>Nếu reschedule → mở lịch interviewer.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>10. Tích hợp Dialogflow CX</h2>

<h3>10.1 Setup</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Tạo Agent trên Google Cloud Dialogflow CX.</li>
  <li>Enable Webhook fulfillment.</li>
  <li>Public webhook URL: <code>https://api.jobmatch.vn/api/v1/dialogflow/webhook</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h3>10.2 Intents</h3>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Intent</th><th>Training phrases</th><th>Webhook action</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>ask_how_to_apply</code></td><td>"làm sao để apply", "cách nộp CV"</td><td>Trả response cố định</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ask_company_info</code></td><td>"công ty X ở đâu", "giới thiệu công ty"</td><td><code>getCompany(name)</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ask_status</code></td><td>"trạng thái application của tôi"</td><td><code>getApplicationStatus(email)</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ask_salary</code></td><td>"lương vị trí X bao nhiêu"</td><td><code>getSalaryInsight(position, location)</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ask_skill_required</code></td><td>"JD cần kỹ năng gì"</td><td><code>getJobRequirements(jobId)</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>escalate_to_human</code></td><td>"tôi muốn nói chuyện với HR"</td><td>Tạo support ticket</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>10.3 Backend webhook (NodeJS)</h3>
<pre><code>router.post('/dialogflow/webhook', async (req, res) =&gt; {
  const intent = req.body.queryResult.intent.displayName;
  const params = req.body.queryResult.parameters;

  switch (intent) {
    case 'ask_company_info': {
      const data = await companyService.getByName(params.company);
      return res.json({ fulfillmentText: data ? `${data.name} - ${data.description}` : 'Không tìm thấy' });
    }
    case 'ask_salary': {
      const insight = await insightService.getSalary(params.position, params.location);
      return res.json({ fulfillmentText: insight });
    }
    // ...
  }
});</code></pre>

<h3>10.4 Embed</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Thêm Dialogflow Messenger widget vào Vue app (script + div).</li>
  <li>Style lại cho phù hợp với JobMatch.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

